{"h":3396,"lines":[{"w":0.062283668518066326,"c":1,"h":0.015757804484193172,"t":"Test 4","x":0.84540137551921613,"y":0.028458307033201624},{"c":1,"y":0.07848837195919911,"x":0.067901235430165144,"w":0.039094648361206061,"t":"AMY:","h":0.010174418787512574},{"x":0.067901234486747064,"t":"JAKE:","y":0.10901162770558526,"w":0.043209877014160153,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.067901233797841007,"w":0.039094651540120443,"t":"AMY:","h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.13953488358223831},{"w":0.043433252970377603,"c":1,"t":"JAKE:","h":0.010658070954052024,"x":0.065731933088440872,"y":0.17126980170574657},{"w":0.039094648361206047,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"AMY:","y":0.20348837187225199,"x":0.067901235634211785,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.16666666122296522,"t":"Absolutely. New York is a good example of how not to introduce a scheme. When","y":0.077034883601224902,"c":1,"w":0.64609054565429691},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"they launched it, it was more than ten times the price of most other schemes.","x":0.16460905275223733,"y":0.09156976730805777,"c":1,"w":0.615226338704427},{"x":0.16460905088401043,"t":"More than it costs to take a taxi. Crazy. I think the organisers lacked vision and","y":0.10747938769517018,"w":0.62757202148437496,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1},{"w":0.12405062357584637,"y":0.12143662154043011,"h":0.015355777403491144,"t":"ambition there.","x":0.16437694364747538,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.13808139521589258,"c":1,"t":"I think so too. Sydney would be a good example to use. I would have expected it","x":0.16460904805696572,"w":0.6460905456542968},{"y":0.15400471135436145,"w":0.26954732259114583,"c":1,"x":0.16666666781377454,"t":"to have grown pretty quickly here.","h":0.011778563015312105},{"h":0.014552004064912638,"t":"Yes. I can't quite work out why it hasn't been an instant success like some of the","x":0.16460904899500736,"c":1,"y":0.16860465102972022,"w":0.63991770426432293},{"x":0.16666666813247716,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.18459302313099279,"c":1,"t":"others. It's a shame really.","w":0.21193415323893228},{"h":0.013250883392226243,"c":1,"y":0.20200235589010318,"t":"I know. OK so now we've thought about ...","w":0.3395061747233073,"x":0.16666666563959448},{"w":0.034979422887166378,"x":0.83950617325291887,"c":1,"t":"Q29","y":0.10610465144336523,"h":0.013081394460653373},{"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.15261627891133434,"x":0.83950617344305101,"t":"Q30"},{"t":"PART 4","x":0.069958847513863942,"y":0.25145348822633729,"w":0.10493827184041341,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"t":"One of the most famous cases of extinction is that of a bird known as the dodo. In fact there's","x":0.069958851654570067,"y":0.27761627932785249,"c":1,"w":0.74279836018880208,"h":0.015988371257085632},{"h":0.015993508068214979,"y":0.29505300370042975,"c":1,"t":"even a saying in English, 'as dead as the dodo', used to refer to something which no longer","w":0.72839508056640623,"x":0.067901225046771388},{"y":0.31095406351075272,"h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.71604939778645826,"t":"exists. But for many centuries the dodo was alive and well, although it could only be found","x":0.069958840107599091,"c":1},{"x":0.067901242231782344,"y":0.32558139520108176,"w":0.72633743286132812,"t":"in one place, the island of Mauritius in the Indian Ocean. It was a very large bird, about one","h":0.015996932421752819,"c":1},{"t":"metre tall, and over the centuries it had lost the ability to fly, but it survived happily under the","c":1,"x":0.067901241381053981,"y":0.34156976730895261,"w":0.732510274251302,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"y":0.35747938771710097,"x":0.069958850009540025,"w":0.23456789652506507,"c":1,"t":"trees that covered the island.","h":0.011778563015311994},{"y":0.37926972889457278,"x":0.072016465182331804,"t":"Then in the year 1507 the first Portuguese ships stopped at the island. The sailors were","w":0.69341562906901033,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"t":"carrying spices back to Europe, and found the island a convenient stopping place where","y":0.3953488370891427,"x":0.069958851112383133,"w":0.69958847045898442},{"c":1,"w":0.71399175008138027,"y":0.41133720918278383,"t":"they could stock up with food and water for the rest of the voyage, but they didn't settle on","x":0.069958857361088561,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"Mauritius. However, in 1638 the Dutch arrived and set up a colony there. These first human","x":0.06790124230789947,"y":0.42579505307968024,"w":0.72633743286132812},{"c":1,"x":0.067901228813617209,"t":"inhabitants of the island found the dodo birds a convenient source of meat, although not","y":0.44186046499680165,"h":0.013086531271782831,"w":0.70370371500651041},{"x":0.072016460695535758,"t":"everyone liked the taste.","w":0.19547325134277344,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"y":0.45784883708909674},{"t":"It's hard to get an accurate description of what the dodo actually looked like. We do have","y":0.47965116264907115,"c":1,"x":0.067901245451653172,"h":0.014534883982160851,"w":0.70781890869140618},{"y":0.49558303882758636,"h":0.013250883392226243,"t":"some written records from sailors, and a few pictures, but we don't know how reliable these","w":0.72427983601888013,"x":0.069958847342075317,"c":1},{"w":0.70995142618815099,"h":0.014596841360570711,"y":0.51018332144700684,"c":1,"x":0.069921574022643637,"t":"are. The best-known picture is a Dutch painting in which the bird appears to be extremely"},{"y":0.52616279057285331,"x":0.069958839290384753,"w":0.72222223917643236,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"fat, but this may not be accurate - an Indian painting done at the same time shows a much","c":1},{"h":0.01338658596798159,"c":1,"x":0.067862006104926612,"w":0.10090150197347005,"y":0.54199856746659314,"t":"thinner bird."},{"x":0.069958852028045013,"h":0.014570836043610647,"t":"Although attempts were made to preserve the bodies of some of the birds, no complete","c":1,"w":0.69341562906901044,"y":0.56537102454993848},{"h":0.013250883392226243,"y":0.57979976455661819,"w":0.74691360473632806,"c":1,"t":"specimen survives. In the early 17th century four dried parts of a bird were known to exist - of","x":0.069958835441554096},{"c":1,"y":0.59484912732394291,"t":"these, three have disappeared, so only one example of soft tissue from the dodo survives, a","w":0.73259038289388023,"x":0.069923052057360643,"h":0.015728084442893531},{"t":"dodo head. Bones have also been found, but there's only one complete skeleton in existence.","w":0.74897120157877595,"h":0.014557139752750747,"x":0.067901230377115665,"c":1,"y":0.61189634874782628},{"y":0.63368669049081738,"w":0.74279836018880208,"c":1,"h":0.014569123586018917,"x":0.067901231511566018,"t":"This single dodo skeleton has recently been the subject of scientific research which suggests"},{"c":1,"w":0.70781890869140618,"t":"that many of the earlier beliefs about dodos may have been incorrect. For example, early","x":0.06790124513868312,"y":0.64958775027926507,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"t":"accounts of the birds mention how slow and clumsy it was, but scientists now believe the","c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.067901245152406059,"y":0.66569767429884119,"w":0.70781890869140618},{"y":0.68021201414485022,"t":"bird's strong knee joints would have made it capable of movement which was not slow, but","x":0.072016461457003134,"w":0.71810699462890626,"h":0.013101939458588729,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.067901240436243307,"w":0.73868311564127598,"h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.6961130739286967,"t":"actually quite fast. In fact, one 17th century sailor wrote that he found the birds hard to catch."},{"y":0.71220930221933798,"t":"It's true that the dodo's small wings wouldn't have allowed it to leave the ground, but the","h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.69958847045898431,"x":0.069958851086140708,"c":1},{"h":0.01454173212759069,"x":0.067901225963635736,"y":0.72673733776755944,"c":1,"t":"scientists suggest that these were probably employed for balance while going over uneven","w":0.72222223917643236},{"x":0.069958852979146252,"y":0.74263839813967747,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"ground. Another group of scientists carried out analysis of the dodo's skull. They found","w":0.68724278767903635,"c":1},{"w":0.72031117757161456,"c":1,"y":0.75517261770023181,"t":"that the reports of the lack of intelligence of the dodo were not borne out by their research,","x":0.069897261031471397,"h":0.016656971090112327},{"x":0.069958839157552952,"y":0.77325581383399944,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.72222223917643225,"t":"which suggested the bird's brain was not small, but average in size. In fact, in relation to its","c":1},{"x":0.069958848263821857,"y":0.78916372174945781,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"w":0.71810699462890626,"t":"body size, it was similar to that of the pigeon, which is known to be a highly intelligent bird."},{"w":0.70781890869140618,"t":"The researchers also found that the structure of the bird's skull suggested that one sense","y":0.80377906964347556,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.072016471598378234,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.067901226927275793,"y":0.81976744172760674,"w":0.71604939778645837,"t":"which was particularly well-developed was that of smell. So the dodo may also have been","h":0.014534883982160851},{"c":1,"w":0.66058736165364584,"h":0.015149153584726238,"x":0.071960172200734571,"y":0.8356659769244561,"t":"particularly good at locating ripe fruit and other food in the island's thick vegetation."},{"w":0.034979422887166267,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.39534883707061041,"c":1,"t":"Q31","x":0.83950617322719878},{"t":"Q32","y":0.42587209288456385,"w":0.037037035624186254,"x":0.83950617343699907,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"x":0.83950617343699907,"y":0.52616279055898252,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"Q33"},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.61046511611791132,"t":"Q34","x":0.83744856050389638,"w":0.039094648361206019,"c":1},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"Q35","h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.83950617344910272,"y":0.68023255800084292,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"Q36","y":0.72674418590781964,"x":0.83950617344910272,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"x":0.83950617344910272,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"t":"Q37","y":0.77325581381479636},{"t":"Q38","x":0.83950617344910272,"y":0.81976744170443661,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.87037037097996683,"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"119","y":0.90261627891373908},{"w":0.2522576904296876,"x":0.71953504897722032,"y":0.95567424039862925,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","h":0.026877635780577114,"c":1}],"w":2400}